            "name": "title",
            "namespace": "http://oval.mitre.org/XMLSchema/oval-definitions-5",
            "text": "OL09-00-000401 - OL 9 must be configured so that the pcscd service is active."
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "family": "unix"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "name": "platform",
                "namespace": "http://oval.mitre.org/XMLSchema/oval-definitions-5",
                "text": "Oracle Linux 9"
              }
            ],
            "name": "affected",
            "namespace": "http://oval.mitre.org/XMLSchema/oval-definitions-5"
          },
          {
            "name": "description",
            "namespace": "http://oval.mitre.org/XMLSchema/oval-definitions-5",
            "text": "The information system ensures that even if the information system is compromised, that compromise will not affect credentials stored on the authentication device.\n\n\tThe daemon program for pcsc-lite and the MuscleCard framework is pcscd. It is a resource manager that coordinates communications with smart card readers and smart cards and cryptographic tokens that are connected to the system."
          }
        ],
        "name": "metadata",
        "namespace": "http://oval.mitre.org/XMLSchema/oval-definitions-5"
